OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader criticises
OL,4,A'bonkers' lifeboat plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to replace a coastal city's
OL,7,Fall-weather lifeboat with a smaller
OL,8,Fmodel have been described as "bonkers"
OL,9,Fby its council leader.
OL,11,FThe RNLI confirmed Plymouth would be
OL,12,Fgiven a new Coastal class boat in 2030
OL,13,Fafter the charity had carried out a
OL,14,Freview of its nationwide fleet. It
OL,15,Fwould replace the Devon city's current
OL,16,FSevern-class vessel - the largest in
OL,17,Fthe RNLI's current fleet.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
