OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader criticises
OL,4,A'bonkers' lifeboat plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlymouth City Council leader Tudor
OL,7,FEvans said there had been "no
OL,8,Fconsultation" on the move and it would
OL,9,F"diminish" the service the RNLI could
OL,10,Foffer from the city.
OL,12,FThe BBC has approached the RNLI for
OL,13,Fcomment, but the charity previously
OL,14,Fsaid the new Coastal class model was
OL,15,Fmore sustainable and cost-effective.
